<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Appliance Pickup Partner Program | Free Reliable Appliance Pickup</title>

<meta name="description" content="Join the Free Reliable Appliance Pickup partner network. Search service areas across the United States, choose up to 50 cities, and apply for appliance pickup territory opportunities.">

<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">

<link rel="canonical" href="https://free-reliable-appliance-pickup.github.io/free-reliable-appliance-pickup-solutions/partners/">

<style>
*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    background:#f5f7f6;
    color:#222;
    line-height:1.6;
}

header{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b5d35,#087443);
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:55px 20px;
}

header h1{
    margin:0 0 12px;
    font-size:38px;
}

header p{
    max-width:850px;
    margin:auto;
    font-size:18px;
}

nav{
    background:#063f25;
    text-align:center;
    padding:12px;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:0 12px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.container{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:35px 20px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:28px;
    margin-bottom:25px;
    border-radius:12px;
    box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

h2{
    color:#0b5d35;
    margin-top:0;
}

h3{
    color:#17352a;
}

.green-box{
    background:#eef8f2;
    border-left:5px solid #0b5d35;
    padding:18px;
    margin:20px 0;
}

.steps{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
    gap:18px;
}

.step{
    background:#f7faf8;
    border:1px solid #d8e5dd;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.step strong{
    color:#0b5d35;
    display:block;
    font-size:18px;
    margin-bottom:7px;
}

label{
    display:block;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-top:16px;
    margin-bottom:6px;
}

input,
select,
textarea{
    width:100%;
    padding:13px;
    border:1px solid #bbb;
    border-radius:7px;
    font-size:16px;
    background:white;
}

textarea{
    min-height:110px;
    resize:vertical;
}

button{
    border:0;
    border-radius:7px;
    padding:13px 20px;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.primary{
    background:#0b5d35;
    color:white;
}

.primary:hover{
    background:#087443;
}

.secondary{
    background:#e8f3ed;
    color:#0b5d35;
}

.letters{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:7px;
    margin:15px 0;
}

.letter{
    width:38px;
    height:38px;
    padding:0;
    border:1px solid #b7cfc1;
    background:white;
    color:#0b5d35;
    border-radius:6px;
}

.letter:hover,
.letter.active{
    background:#0b5d35;
    color:white;
}

.city-toolbar{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:15px;
}

.city-results{
    margin-top:18px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));
    gap:10px;
    max-height:420px;
    overflow:auto;
    border:1px solid #d8e5dd;
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:9px;
    background:#fafcfb;
}

.city-item{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:9px;
    border:1px solid #d8e5dd;
    padding:10px;
    border-radius:7px;
    background:white;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.city-item:hover{
    border-color:#0b5d35;
}

.city-item input{
    width:auto;
    margin:0;
}

.selected-area{
    margin-top:20px;
}

.selected-cities{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:8px;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.city-tag{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:7px;
    background:#eef8f2;
    color:#0b5d35;
    border:1px solid #bcd7c8;
    padding:7px 10px;
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:14px;
}

.city-tag button{
    background:none;
    color:#b00020;
    padding:0;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1;
}

.counter{
    margin-top:10px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#0b5d35;
}

.status{
    padding:12px;
    margin-top:15px;
    border-radius:7px;
    display:none;
}

.status.success{
    display:block;
    background:#e8f7ee;
    color:#075c32;
}

.status.error{
    display:block;
    background:#fff0f0;
    color:#a00000;
}

.loading{
    padding:20px;
    text-align:center;
    color:#555;
}

.manual-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.notice{
    font-size:14px;
    color:#555;
}

footer{
    margin-top:30px;
    background:#17352a;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:28px 20px;
}

footer a{
    color:white;
}

@media(max-width:700px){

    header h1{
        font-size:30px;
    }

    .city-toolbar{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .manual-row{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    nav a{
        display:inline-block;
        margin:5px 8px;
    }

    .card{
        padding:20px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Appliance Pickup Partner Program</h1>
    <p>
        Join the Free Reliable Appliance Pickup partner network and request
        appliance pickup territory opportunities throughout the United States.
        Search by state, city name, or letter A–Z and choose up to 50 cities.
    </p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="../">Home</a>
    <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
    <a href="#territories">Choose Cities</a>
    <a href="#application">Apply</a>
</nav>

<main class="container">

<section class="card">

<h2>Grow Your Appliance Pickup Business</h2>

<p>
Free Reliable Appliance Pickup is building a nationwide network of independent
appliance pickup partners.
</p>

